From 7e011a84f51dbae4f27e40e22cbc60fa73bd573c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 13:57:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(gi): built-in Anastasya, Danica, Silverdawn and Torrents
 of Spring

The four ship with GO from their custom character packs, with bundled
images, so they are available without importing anything and survive
clearing site data.

A definition saved under the same key (edited in the editor) takes a
built-in's place, and can be reset to the built-in version. A pack
character or weapon imported before (same source id) keeps being used,
so its builds stay, and gets the bundled images. Unchanged built-ins are
not written to localStorage, so they follow the shipped version.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Asb8vZRqeTYT9zLpVizGNv
