+        "name": "The Radiant Reign of Night",
+        "description": "All party members gain Accolades for 20s after Anastasya uses her Elemental Skill Polestar's Divine Judgment, increasing their CRIT DMG by 12%.\nWhen a party member is Sealed, their Accolades are temporarily divided equally among party members who are not Sealed until 8s after that character's Sealed state ends.",
