+      "passive2": {
+        "name": "Lament for the Lost",
+        "description": "While Anastasya is in the party, Stellar Glimmer reactions triggered by any party member gain the following effects:\n·Stellar-Conduct: The Polestar Field will be further enhanced each time it grants a buff, and creating a Starlight Prism will cause the Field to generate a buff instantly;\n·Stellar Swirl: Stellar Swirl's base reaction multiplier is increased by 15%. Newly created Stellar Vortices and Drifting Vortices are also immediately raised to Level 2. This level increase can trigger once every 1s.",
